# Repository hygiene — keep session artifacts and OS/editor cruft out of git.

# The root-level plan.md is a per-session cache, never committed
# (.github/skills/session-orchestration/SKILL.md). Root-anchored on purpose:
# plan.md files elsewhere (e.g. spec-kit's specs/**/plan.md) are real content.
/plan.md

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor swap/backup files
*.swp
*.swo
*~
